			<string key="org:resource" value="assistant" />
			<int key="step" value="8" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "User anya_garcia_5901 is requesting to speak with a supervisor to verify their membership status. The system shows their membership level as Silver, but the user believes they should be Gold. This affects their checked baggage allowance calculation for reservation JMO1MG (a one-way economy flight from DEN to MIA on 2024-05-16 with 2 passengers). As a Silver member with economy class, the current allowance is 4 free checked bags (2 per passenger). If upgraded to Gold, it would be 6 free checked bags (3 per passenger). User prefers numeric responses for bag counts."}' />
