			<int key="step" value="8" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "User James Lee (user ID: james_lee_6136) has reservation XEWRD9, a round-trip basic economy booking from LAX to ATL and back. The outbound flights (LAX\u2192ORD on May 13, ORD\u2192ATL on May 14) have already been flown. The return flights are scheduled for May 21 (ATL\u2192DFW\u2192LAX). \n\nThe user wants to change the return destination from LAX to LAS (Las Vegas) and switch to a nonstop flight from ATL to LAS on May 21. This change is not permitted under standard modification rules because: (1) basic economy cannot be modified, (2) destination cannot be changed, and (3) part of the trip has already been flown.\n\nThe user is willing to upgrade to regular economy if it helps and is requesting to speak with a supervisor or rebooking desk to explore any possible exceptions or alternative options. The reservation has travel insurance and 2 passengers (James Lee and Mason Lopez)."}' />
