			<date key="time:timestamp" value="2026-01-01T00:00:24+00:00" />
			<string key="org:resource" value="assistant" />
			<int key="step" value="24" />
			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;User Sophia Silva (user_id: sophia_silva_7557) needs help managing her future reservations based on flight durations, which I cannot access with available tools.\n\n**User's requests:**\n1. **Cancel** any future reservation that includes a flight longer than 4 hours\n2. **Upgrade to business** any reservation that is 3 hours or less total (including layovers), but provide the total upgrade cost FIRST before processing\n\n**Important constraints:**\n- Cancellation reason is NOT health or weather-related (user explicitly confirmed she is healthy)\n- User wants cost confirmation before any upgrades are made\n\n**Future reservations to evaluate:**\n- **NM1VX1**: MSP \u2194 EWR round trip, Basic Economy, 1 passenger, has travel insurance\n- **KC18K6**: MSP \u2192 CLT one-way (via EWR), Basic Economy, 1 passenger, has travel insurance\n- **S61CZX**: LAX \u2194 CLT round trip (via EWR, 4 flights), Economy, 1 passenger, has travel insurance\n- **H8Q05L**: JFK \u2192 ATL one-way, Basic Economy, 1 passenger, has travel insurance\n\n**Note on cancellation eligibility:** Since the reason is not health/weather-related, cancellations would only be possible if the booking was made within 24 hours (none were), the flight was cancelled by airline, or it's a business class booking (none are). The human agent should verify cancellation eligibility based on these policies.\n\n**User's payment methods available:** Credit card (Visa ending 7238), gift card ($274), and two travel certificates ($500 and $150).&quot;}" />
			<boolean key="tool_error" value="false" />
			<int key="epoch_us" value="1771925523495523" />
			<int key="turn_idx" value="24" />
