			<int key="step" value="15" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Noah Muller (user ID: noah_muller_9847, gold member) is requesting compensation for a delayed flight. Reservation 4OG6T3 is a round-trip basic economy booking from BOS to LAS with travel insurance. The outbound connecting flight HAT018 (SEA \u2192 LAS) on May 11, 2024 was delayed, which the customer says disrupted their arrival plans. \n\nThe customer is requesting compensation for the delay but does not want to change or cancel the reservation. Per policy, delay compensation ($50/passenger) is only available when the customer changes or cancels the reservation. However, the reservation is basic economy (cannot be modified) and part of the trip has already been flown (cannot be cancelled by the agent). \n\nThe customer feels this is unfair since the delay already impacted them and the booking restrictions prevent them from taking the actions that would qualify them for compensation. The customer initially claimed 3 passengers, but the reservation shows only 1 passenger (Noah Muller). Return flights (LAS \u2192 SEA \u2192 BOS) are scheduled for May 17, 2024."}' />
			<boolean key="tool_error" value="false" />
			<int key="epoch_us" value="1771925558122408" />
