			<int key="step" value="10" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Anya Garcia (user ID: anya_garcia_5901) is requesting cancellation and full refund for reservation 3RK2T9. The customer claims she booked the flight by mistake approximately 10 hours ago (on May 15, 2024), but the system shows the reservation was created on May 2, 2024. The reservation is for a one-way basic economy flight from MCO to SFO (via PHX) on May 19-20, 2024, for 2 passengers (Anya Garcia and Mei Lee), paid with gift card ($280), no insurance. Customer requests a human agent review possible rebooking, modification, or reissued ticket that might explain the date discrepancy. Standard cancellation policy does not allow refund since the booking is outside the 24-hour window, is basic economy, and has no travel insurance."}' />
