			<int key="step" value="6" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "User Lucas Brown (user_id: lucas_brown_4047) is requesting to reschedule reservation EUJUY6 by 2 days due to the death of his wife yesterday. The reservation is a round-trip basic economy booking from ORD to LAS with a connection through DEN (outbound) and IAH (return). The outbound flights were on May 14, 2024 (already passed), and the return flights are on May 16, 2024. There are 3 passengers. The reservation has travel insurance. Per policy, basic economy flights cannot be modified, and part of the trip has already passed. The user is not seeking a refund or cancellation\u2014he specifically wants to shift the entire trip by 2 days. He is requesting human agent assistance for any possible flexibility given his bereavement circumstances."}' />
