			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "The user is requesting to cancel only the travel insurance on their reservation while keeping the flight active, and is asking for a full refund of the insurance premium. This is outside standard policy, as insurance cannot be removed after initial booking. The user has expressed frustration with the service they received when purchasing the insurance and is requesting that a human agent review their case and potentially make an exception. The user has not yet provided their user ID or reservation ID."}' />
