			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Yara Garcia (user_id: yara_garcia_1905) wants to modify reservation HXDUBJ with the following changes:\n1. Change outbound flight from May 18 (HAT085+HAT023 one-stop) to May 19 HAT072 (nonstop IAH\u2192SFO, departs 9am)\n2. Change return flight from May 22 to May 23 HAT278 (SFO\u2192IAH, departs 4pm)\n3. Upgrade cabin from economy to business\n4. Add 2 checked bags (should be free with gold membership + business class)\n\nPrice difference is $192 ($725 new business fare - $533 original economy fare). Customer wants to pay with gift_card_1646646 which has $200 balance - sufficient to cover the $192. However, the system keeps returning \"Gift card balance is not enough\" error. Customer needs a human agent to manually process this transaction and override the system limitation."}' />
