			<int key="step" value="6" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "User Lucas Brown (user_id: lucas_brown_4047) is requesting to modify reservation EUJUY6. His wife passed away yesterday and he needs to move his return flights out by two days. \n\nCurrent situation:\n- Reservation is basic economy (which normally cannot be modified)\n- Round trip: ORD \u2192 LAS (via DEN) and return LAS \u2192 ORD (via IAH)\n- Outbound flights on May 14, 2024 have already been flown\n- Return flights are scheduled for May 16, 2024 (LAS \u2192 IAH \u2192 ORD)\n- He wants to move return flights to May 18, 2024\n- Reservation has travel insurance\n- 3 passengers total\n- User explicitly does NOT want to cancel - only wants to change the return date\n\nUser is requesting an exception to the basic economy modification policy due to bereavement circumstances."}' />
