			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Anya Garcia (user ID: anya_garcia_5901) wants to cancel reservation 3RK2T9 (basic economy, one-way MCO\u2192SFO via PHX on May 19-20, 2024, for 2 passengers) due to illness. She believes she purchased travel insurance during booking, but the reservation record shows insurance: \"no\" and the payment amount ($280) matches only the flight costs without insurance ($60 for 2 passengers would have brought total to $340). Customer is requesting investigation into whether insurance was selected but not properly attached to the reservation. She would like this corrected so she can proceed with a cancellation and refund covered by insurance. Agent cannot add insurance after initial booking per policy, so human review is needed to investigate the booking transaction."}' />
