			<int key="step" value="7" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Ethan Martin (user ID: ethan_martin_2396), a silver member, is calling about flight HAT039 from ATL to SEA which is confirmed delayed on 2024-05-15. The customer has two requests: (1) He wants to know the specific reason for the delay (e.g., crew, maintenance, weather, ATC), which I do not have access to in my system. (2) He is requesting compensation (travel voucher or refund to original payment) for the delay WITHOUT changing or canceling his reservation. Per policy, I can only offer delay compensation when the customer modifies or cancels, but the customer believes this is unreasonable and wants a supervisor to review compensation options. He is not looking to change his travel plans\u2014just seeking an explanation and fair remedy for the inconvenience."}' />
