			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;Customer emma_kim_9957 (Emma Kim, gold member) wants to cancel reservation EHGLP3 for a change of plans. The reservation is a basic economy one-way flight from PHX to JFK via SEA on May 17, 2024, for 2 passengers (Evelyn Taylor and Anya Silva), with no travel insurance. Total paid: $208 via credit card.\n\nCancellation does not meet standard policy criteria:\n- Booking was made on May 4, 2024 (more than 24 hours ago)\n- Basic economy cabin (not business)\n- No travel insurance\n- Reason is change of plans (not airline cancellation)\n\nCustomer's concerns:\n1. She was out of town and couldn't cancel within the 24-hour window\n2. She claims she was told she didn't need insurance because a previous trip with the same agency had insurance, suggesting possible miscommunication about how insurance works\n\nCustomer is seeking an exception or refund option based on these circumstances.&quot;}" />
