			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;Customer Ethan Martin (user ID: ethan_martin_2396) has reservation M61CQM, a one-way economy flight from ORD to SEA on May 15, 2024 with 3 passengers (Ethan Martin, Mia Thomas, Liam Johnson). Flight HAT039 (ATL to SEA) is confirmed delayed. Customer is requesting: 1) The specific reason/cause code for the delay on flight HAT039 on May 15, 2024 - agent tools only show \&quot;delayed\&quot; status without detailed reason. 2) Compensation (voucher or credit) for the delay WITHOUT canceling or changing the reservation - customer still needs to travel to Seattle. Customer is a silver member, no travel insurance on this booking. Policy only allows delay compensation when customer changes/cancels, but customer disputes this as unfair since the delay is airline's responsibility regardless of whether they still fly. Customer is frustrated and requesting supervisor review of compensation options.&quot;}" />
