			<string key="concept:name" value="transfer_to_human_agents" />
			<date key="time:timestamp" value="2026-01-01T00:00:35+00:00" />
			<string key="org:resource" value="assistant" />
			<int key="step" value="35" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "User Noah Muller (user_id: noah_muller_9847) is requesting goodwill compensation for a delayed flight without changing or canceling their reservation. Reservation 4OG6T3 (BOS \u2192 LAS round-trip, basic economy, 1 passenger) had flight HAT018 (SEA \u2192 LAS) on May 11, 2024 confirmed as delayed, which the user says disrupted their plans. The user is a gold member with travel insurance on this reservation. Per policy, compensation for delays ($50/passenger) requires the user to change or cancel the reservation, but the user does not want to do either\u2014they simply want compensation for the inconvenience caused by the delay that already occurred. The user is frustrated and feels the policy is unfair. They are explicitly requesting a human agent who may have more flexibility to offer goodwill compensation without requiring a change or cancellation."}' />
