			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;User emma_kim_9957 is requesting cancellation of reservation EHGLP3 (basic economy, one-way, PHX\u2192SEA\u2192JFK on May 17, 2024, 2 passengers, no insurance, booked on May 4, 2024). The reason for cancellation is \&quot;change of plans\&quot; - user was out of town and couldn't handle this sooner. The reservation does not meet standard cancellation criteria (not within 24 hours, not airline-cancelled, not business class, no travel insurance). User claims they were told they didn't need insurance because a previous trip was booked with insurance and assumed they'd be covered similarly. User is requesting a human agent to review if an exception or refund is possible given the misunderstanding about insurance coverage.&quot;}" />
