			<int key="step" value="17" />
			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;Customer Sophia Silva (user ID: sophia_silva_7557) is requesting compensation for a claimed cancelled business flight earlier this month (May 2024) that caused her to miss an important work meeting. The reservation was allegedly booked through her company's corporate travel system and is not appearing in her personal account. I verified all 5 reservations in her personal account\u2014none are business class, and the only past flights (WUNA5K, May 10-11, economy class) both landed successfully. The customer does not have the reservation ID and cannot quickly access the corporate booking details. She is requesting compensation for both the cancellation and the missed meeting/business disruption. She is a regular member. Policy requires fact confirmation before compensation can be issued, which I cannot complete without the reservation information.&quot;}" />
