			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;User amelia_davis_8890 wants to cancel reservation UDMOP1 (basic economy, SFO round trip via PHX and PHL on May 28-29, 2024, 1 passenger, no insurance, created May 9). The reservation does not meet standard cancellation criteria (not within 24 hours of booking, not a business flight, no travel insurance, flight not cancelled by airline). However, the user explicitly wants to voluntarily forfeit the ticket without a refund so the seats can be released back into inventory for others. The user is asking if there's a \&quot;cancel without refund\&quot; or \&quot;voluntary forfeit\&quot; option available. This falls outside the agent's standard cancellation policy and requires human assistance.&quot;}" />
