			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;User james_lee_6136 has reservation XEWRD9, a basic economy round-trip from LAX to ATL. The outbound flights (May 13-14) have already been flown. The user wants to change the return flight on May 21 from ATL \u2192 LAX (currently one-stop via DFW) to a nonstop ATL \u2192 LAS (Las Vegas). \n\nTwo policy blockers prevent this:\n1. Cabin cannot be upgraded because some flights have already been flown\n2. Even with an upgrade, changing the return destination from LAX to LAS is not permitted as it changes the trip's origin/destination\n\nThe user is willing to pay up to $100 in change fees and has requested to speak with a supervisor or ticketing/support desk to confirm their options.&quot;}" />
