			<int key="step" value="8" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Anya Garcia (user ID: anya_garcia_5901) wants to cancel reservation 3RK2T9 (one-way basic economy flight from MCO to SFO on May 19-20, 2024, for 2 passengers) due to illness. She claims she purchased travel insurance at booking, but the reservation shows \"insurance: no\" and the payment of $280 matches flight costs exactly without insurance. Customer is requesting a refund using the travel insurance she believes she purchased. She needs a human agent to investigate whether travel insurance was purchased but not properly recorded in the system."}' />
