			<int key="step" value="18" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Silver member Ethan Martin (user ID: ethan_martin_2396) is calling about flight HAT039 from ATL to SEA on May 15, 2024, which is confirmed delayed. Reservation ID is M61CQM (economy class, 3 passengers, no travel insurance). The customer is upset about the delay and is requesting: 1) An explanation for why the flight is delayed (system only shows \"delayed\" status, not the reason), and 2) Compensation in the form of a travel voucher or refund to original payment method (credit card ending in 8023) WITHOUT canceling or changing his reservation. He does not want to modify his booking. Standard policy only allows delay compensation when customer changes/cancels, but customer believes as a silver member he should be eligible for compensation regardless. He has explicitly requested escalation to a supervisor or customer relations team who can authorize compensation outside standard policy parameters."}' />
