			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Aarav Ahmed (user ID: aarav_ahmed_6699) is requesting assistance with three reservations:\n\n1. **IFOYYZ** (CLT \u2192 EWR, Round Trip, Basic Economy, May 28-30, 2024, 1 passenger, $116 paid): Customer wants to cancel this reservation and is asking if a flight credit option with a cancellation fee is possible, or if any policy exceptions can be made. The reservation does not qualify for standard cancellation (basic economy, no insurance, booked more than 24 hours ago).\n\n2. **NQNU5R** (MCO \u2192 SEA, One Way, Business, May 13-14, 2024, 2 passengers, $6,178 paid): This reservation has already been fully flown. Customer is asking if there are any refundable taxes/fees or unused portions that can be refunded.\n\n3. **M20IZO** (JFK \u2192 MCO, One Way, Economy, May 22, 2024, 2 passengers, $490 paid): Customer wants to change to a nonstop flight. No direct JFK-MCO flights are available on May 21-23. Customer is flexible and willing to depart from EWR or LGA instead of JFK, and/or arrive at SFB instead of MCO, if it helps find a nonstop option.\n\nFor any applicable fees or fare differences, customer requests charges be applied to credit card ending in 7334 (credit_card_9074831)."}' />
