			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Noah Muller (user ID: noah_muller_9847) is requesting investigation into a passenger discrepancy on reservation 4OG6T3 (BOS to LAS round-trip, basic economy, with travel insurance). The customer believes there were 3 passengers on this booking, but the system only shows 1 passenger (Noah Muller). Flight HAT018 on May 11th was delayed, and the customer is eligible for delay compensation as a gold member with travel insurance. The customer is requesting $150 compensation ($50 x 3 passengers) but the system only supports $50 (for 1 passenger). Customer wants a human agent to investigate whether other passengers were attached to this reservation or if records were changed before accepting any compensation."}' />
