			<int key="step" value="17" />
			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;Customer Yara Garcia (user_id: yara_garcia_1905) is requesting modifications to reservation HXDUBJ:\n\n**Current reservation:** Round-trip IAH\u2192SFO, economy class, originally paid $533 via gift_card_6941833. Customer has travel insurance.\n\n**Requested changes:**\n1. Change outbound from one-stop (HAT085+HAT023) on May 18 to nonstop HAT072 on May 19 (9am departure)\n2. Change return from HAT278 on May 22 to HAT278 on May 23\n3. Upgrade cabin from economy to business\n4. Add 2 checked bags (should be free as Gold member in business)\n\n**Pricing:** New flights total $725 in business. Difference from original $533 should be $192.\n\n**Issue 1 - System error:** When attempting to charge the $192 difference to gift_card_1646646 ($200 balance), the system returned \&quot;Gift card balance is not enough.\&quot; The exchange should credit the original $533 and only charge the $192 difference, but the system appears to be trying to charge the full amount.\n\n**Issue 2 - Insurance policy:** Customer states they read on the website that travel insurance waives change fees, and is requesting this policy be honored. I don't have documentation of this policy to verify or apply.\n\nCustomer is willing to pay the $192 fare difference but not additional change fees, and needs the system issue resolved.&quot;}" />
			<boolean key="tool_error" value="false" />
			<int key="epoch_us" value="1771925742458869" />
