			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Noah Muller (user ID: noah_muller_9847) experienced a delay on flight HAT018 (SEA \u2192 LAS) on May 11, 2024, which was part of reservation 4OG6T3 (BOS \u2192 LAS round trip, basic economy, 1 passenger). The customer is a gold member with travel insurance on this reservation. The delay caused significant disruption to their trip. The customer wants to keep their return flights (May 17) as scheduled but is requesting goodwill compensation for the delay. I initially offered a $50 certificate but then had to correct myself and explain that compensation for delays is only available when the reservation is changed or cancelled. The customer is frustrated by this inconsistency and is requesting escalation for a goodwill review."}' />
