			<int key="step" value="15" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Raj Sanchez (user ID: raj_sanchez_7340) is requesting to cancel reservation Q69X3R (round-trip economy flight from PHL to LGA, May 20-23, 2024, 1 passenger, $430 paid via gift card). The reservation does not meet standard cancellation criteria for a refund: it was booked more than 24 hours ago (created May 14, 2024 at 9:52 AM), is economy class, has no travel insurance, and the reason for cancellation is change of plans. However, the customer states that a previous customer support representative told them an agent would be able to help cancel this reservation and it sounded like it was approved. The customer only wants to cancel if they receive a full refund or credit back to the same gift card. Customer is requesting escalation to a supervisor to honor the alleged prior approval."}' />
