			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "User Lucas Brown (user ID: lucas_brown_4047) is requesting to move reservation EUJUY6 out by two days. His wife passed away yesterday, and he is in distress. The reservation is a round-trip from ORD to LAS in basic economy class with travel insurance. The outbound flights (ORD\u2192DEN\u2192LAS) were on May 14, 2024, which has already passed. The return flights (LAS\u2192IAH\u2192ORD) are scheduled for May 16, 2024. Basic economy policy prevents flight modifications. User does not want to cancel\u2014he specifically wants to reschedule the trip. He is asking if a human agent can make an exception given his bereavement circumstances. There are 3 passengers on the reservation."}' />
