			<string key="org:resource" value="assistant" />
			<int key="step" value="10" />
			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;Customer: Amelia Rossi (user ID: amelia_rossi_1297)\n\nRESERVATION DETAILS:\n- Reservation ID: SI5UKW\n- Route: MIA \u2192 LAS \u2192 PHX (one-way)\n- Flights: HAT062 on May 16, 2024 and HAT284 on May 17, 2024\n- Cabin: Basic Economy\n- Total Paid: $124 (credit card ending in 3507)\n- Booking Date: May 11, 2024\n- Travel Insurance: No\n- Membership: Regular\n\nCUSTOMER REQUEST:\n- Requesting cancellation of reservation SI5UKW due to unexpected personal situation (change of plans)\n- Requesting EITHER a full refund OR a travel voucher/gift card for $124\n- If full refund not possible, requesting 50% back ($62), willing to negotiate but will not accept less than 10% ($12.40)\n- Customer is canceling in advance of travel (flights are May 16-17, current date is May 15)\n\nREASON FOR ESCALATION:\n- Reservation does not meet standard cancellation criteria: basic economy cabin, no travel insurance, regular membership, booked more than 24 hours ago, flights not cancelled by airline\n- Agent does not have authority to issue exceptions, partial refunds, or goodwill vouchers outside of policy\n- Customer is requesting supervisor/escalations review for exception approval\n\nCustomer notes: \&quot;I'm not going away on this \u2014 I paid $124 and it's not reasonable to offer zero value back when I'm canceling in advance.\&quot;&quot;}" />
