			<int key="step" value="15" />
			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "Customer Noah Muller (user ID: noah_muller_9847) has reservation 4OG6T3 (BOS-LAS round trip, basic economy with travel insurance). Two issues: 1) Customer claims the reservation should have 3 passengers but system shows only 1 passenger (Noah Muller). Customer insists they did not book separately. 2) Customer experienced a confirmed delay on flight HAT018 (SEA to LAS) on May 11, 2024 and is requesting compensation, but does not want to change or cancel the upcoming return flights on May 17. Per policy, agent could only offer delay compensation if customer changes/cancels reservation. Customer is requesting the $50 compensation be issued without requiring changes to the reservation, and wants investigation into the passenger count discrepancy."}' />
