			<string key="org:resource" value="assistant" />
			<int key="step" value="19" />
			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;Customer Ivan Rossi (user ID: ivan_rossi_8555) is requesting assistance with reservation OWZ4XL.\n\n**Current Reservation Details:**\n- Route: EWR \u2192 MIA \u2192 LAX (one-way with connection)\n- Date: May 21, 2024\n- Cabin: Basic Economy\n- Passengers: Ivan Rossi, Olivia Santos, Lei Johansson (3 passengers)\n\n**Customer Request:**\n- Wants to change the May 21 EWR departure to a nonstop flight the same day due to a family medical emergency (mother is very sick and he needs to get home sooner)\n- Willing to upgrade from Basic Economy to Economy if needed to enable the flight change\n- Budget: up to $100 total for all changes\n- Prefers the process in two steps: (1) upgrade cabin first and confirm, then (2) change to nonstop and confirm\n\n**Why I Could Not Assist:**\n- Basic economy flights cannot be modified per policy\n- The cabin upgrade cost from Basic Economy to Economy for all 3 passengers is $396, which exceeds the customer's $100 budget\n- Passenger separation is not possible as the number of passengers cannot be modified on a reservation\n- I do not have the ability to apply exceptions or waivers for pricing\n\nCustomer is hoping a human agent may have more flexibility for special circumstances accommodations.&quot;}" />
