			<string key="arguments" value='{"summary": "User Anya Garcia (user ID: anya_garcia_5901) is disputing their membership level. The system shows them as a Silver member, but they believe they should be a Gold member. They have reservation JMO1MG (one-way economy flight DEN to MIA on 2024-05-16 with 2 passengers). They need their membership status verified and then want confirmation of their total checked baggage allowance as a numeric value. As a Silver member with economy class, the current allowance would be 4 bags total (2 per passenger \u00d7 2 passengers). If upgraded to Gold, it would be 6 bags total (3 per passenger \u00d7 2 passengers)."}' />
