			<int key="step" value="8" />
			<string key="arguments" value="{&quot;summary&quot;: &quot;User emma_kim_9957 is requesting to cancel reservation EHGLP3 (one-way basic economy flight from PHX to JFK via SEA on May 17, 2024, for 2 passengers) with a full refund. The reason for cancellation is \&quot;change of plans.\&quot; \n\nThe reservation does not meet standard cancellation criteria: it was booked on May 4, 2024 (more than 24 hours ago), is basic economy class, has no travel insurance, and was not cancelled by the airline.\n\nThe user is requesting an exception/waiver review because:\n1. She was out of town during the 24-hour cancellation window and couldn't cancel in time.\n2. She claims she was told at booking that she didn't need travel insurance because her previous trip with the same agency had insurance.\n\nThe user explicitly stated she only wants to cancel if she can receive a refund. She is a gold member. Total paid: $208 via credit card.&quot;}" />
